ots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/2c181942/D8/0/code.py:354:        # Now verify exactly 1 valid attachment across all 4 rotations x 4 sides.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/2c181942/D8/0/code.py:358:        # We need exactly 1 such (rotation, side) pair across all possibilities.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D14/2/code.py:41:#      local regularities across examples rather than too many degrees of freedom.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D14/2/code.py:66:#    - Across examples, horizontal lines yield tall stacked outputs; vertical lines\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/20270e3b/D14/2/code.py:79:#         * one full straight separator line across the canvas\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:15:#      outline around an irregular enclosed region shaped like an L or a cross.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:23:#      corner of that 4 x 4 box lies outside the L/cross interior, those sprite pixels\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:26:#    - Shape family is limited to two visible categories: L and cross. This keeps the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:39:#      interior mask or they would leak across the missing corners / arms.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:42:#      intersection with the interior is 4-connected, non-empty, and still spans the full\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:47:#    - At least one placeholder is visibly truncated by the L/cross boundary, so the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:366:    \"\"\"Return valid slot boxes whose intersection with the irregular interior stays bbox-sized.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:395:    \"\"\"Build an L or cross interior mask whose valid slot count stays in range.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D11/1/code.py:398:        shape_type = random.choice([\"L\", \"cro