ers) == num_crosses:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:355:        if len(centers) < num_crosses:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:360:        owner_counts = [meta[\"owner_counts\"][i] for i in range(len(meta[\"crosses\"]))]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:363:        if len(meta[\"crosses\"]) != num_crosses:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5961cc34/D12/0/code.py:30:#    object types or hidden state. Uniform sampling across the four inward directions ensures\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5961cc34/D12/0/code.py:45:#    The same occupancy, dilation, and ray-intersection checks keep blobs separated and stop\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5961cc34/D12/0/code.py:49:#    output always extends red away from that cap into the grid. Across a few examples, the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D8/2/code.py:51:#       cross-segment magenta diagonals that could confuse line-color detection.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7b3084d4/D4/1/code.py:273:    if FEATURE == \"cross5\":\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7b3084d4/D4/1/code.py:413:    if FEATURE == \"cross5\":\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/97d7923e/D14/0/code.py:201:MAX_TOTAL_BARS = 10          # max bars across all groups\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/97d7923e/D14/0/code.py:223:    \"\"\"Distribute bar columns across groups with random inter-group spacing.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dfadab01/D3/4/code.py:16:   - Real controls are no longer one colored pixel. Each control is now a small cross:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dfadab01/D3/4/code.py:29:     in input, and its label is now a matching cross centered at (+4, +4) from the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dfadab01/D3/4/code.py:35:     would arise if all cross pixels had the same color. Type is still encoded only by\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/dfadab01/D3/4/code.py:55:   - Center cells are restricted to rows/cols 1..H-2 so the full cross